Grammar

Rule 0     S' -> program
Rule 1     program -> segment_list
Rule 2     segment_list -> segment_list segment
Rule 3     segment_list -> segment
Rule 4     segment -> class_def
Rule 5     segment -> misc
Rule 6     class_def -> CLASS IDENTIFIER inheritance_opt COLON
Rule 7     inheritance_opt -> LPAREN base_classes RPAREN
Rule 8     inheritance_opt -> empty
Rule 9     base_classes -> IDENTIFIER base_class_tail
Rule 10    base_class_tail -> COMMA IDENTIFIER base_class_tail
Rule 11    base_class_tail -> empty
Rule 12    misc -> IDENTIFIER
Rule 13    misc -> OTHER
Rule 14    empty -> <empty>

Terminals, with rules where they appear

CLASS                : 6
COLON                : 6
COMMA                : 10
IDENTIFIER           : 6 9 10 12
LPAREN               : 7
OTHER                : 13
RPAREN               : 7
error                : 

Nonterminals, with rules where they appear

base_class_tail      : 9 10
base_classes         : 7
class_def            : 4
empty                : 8 11
inheritance_opt      : 6
misc                 : 5
program              : 0
segment              : 2 3
segment_list         : 1 2

